<section class="shell seo-overview-block website-faq" aria-labelledby="seo-overview-faq-title">
  <h2 class="design-heading" id="seo-overview-faq-title"><span>SEO FAQs</span></h2>
  <div class="website-faq-list">
    <details name="seo-overview-faq"><summary>What is SEO, and why is it important for my business?<i data-lucide="plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><p>Search engine optimisation makes your website easier to find through search engines like Google. It helps you attract relevant visitors without paying for every click.</p></details>
    <details name="seo-overview-faq"><summary>How long does SEO take to show results?<i data-lucide="plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><p>Some improvements may become visible within weeks, but meaningful growth often takes several months. Timing depends on your industry, competition, website condition and strategy.</p></details>
    <details name="seo-overview-faq"><summary>How much do SEO services cost?<i data-lucide="plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><p>Pricing depends on your goals, website size, competition and the services required. We provide tailored proposals with clear deliverables and transparent pricing.</p></details>
    <details name="seo-overview-faq"><summary>Can SEO help my business get more customers?<i data-lucide="plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><p>SEO can attract people already looking for what you offer. A well-optimised website can then help turn those visits into enquiries and sales.</p></details>
    <details name="seo-overview-faq"><summary>What’s the difference between SEO and AI SEO?<i data-lucide="plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><p>Traditional SEO focuses on search engines such as Google and Bing. AI SEO focuses on making your business easier to discover and reference in AI-powered answers. Both share technical, content and authority foundations.</p></details>
    <details name="seo-overview-faq"><summary>Do I need SEO if I already run Google Ads?<i data-lucide="plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><p>Ads can deliver immediate paid visibility, while SEO builds organic visibility over time. Both can help you reach customers at different stages of their buying journey.</p></details>
    <details name="seo-overview-faq"><summary>Can you optimise my existing website?<i data-lucide="plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><p>Yes. We can identify technical and content opportunities and implement improvements without necessarily rebuilding the entire website.</p></details>
    <details name="seo-overview-faq"><summary>Do you provide SEO for businesses in different countries?<i data-lucide="plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><p>Yes. We support international and multilingual SEO strategies across different countries, languages and markets.</p></details>
  </div>
  <div class="seo-overview-actions"><a class="solid-button" href="/contact?service=seo">Talk to Sales</a><a class="design-link" href="/faq/seo">See all SEO FAQs →</a></div>
</section>
